pe":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104915","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104915.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104915.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-03T14:34:53Z"},"body":"This PR has a few misc changes to the order of includes, and in some cases the order of executed code (such as `Engine::get_singleton()->add_singleton`), which should not change behavior in any meaningful way (if it does, that's a bug). This is a minor cleanup on top of some recent refactors.\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n- Organizes related code to avoid having more `#ifdef` and `#ifndef` directives than necessary, such as in World2D.\r\n- Tries to make the order of these new directives consistent. The order shouldn't matter, so alphabetical: **n**avigation, then **p**hysics, then **x**r, and that also seems to be the dominant order already present in master.\r\n    - Note: If the order does matter somewhere, we should add a comment to explicitly note that.\r\n- Fixes a few cases where `_3D_DISABLED` was used in place of `XR_DISABLED`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{